  "definition": {
    "en": "Configurable axis: Print Standard. A printed product is configured along this variable (enum, multiple selection). Value-domain to be defined.",
    "nb": "Konfigurerbar akse: Trykkstandard. Et trykkprodukt konfigureres langs denne variabelen (enum, multiple valg). Value-domain ikke definert ennå.",
